  "question": {
    "text": "The lines <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><mn>16</mn></mfrac></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac></math> intersect at the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math>. If the distance of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math> from the line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>14</mn><msup><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math> is equal to _____."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "108",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><mn>16</mn></mfrac></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo> </mo><mfenced><mtext>let</mtext></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo> </mo><mfenced><mtext>let</mtext></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>≡</mo><mo>(1,1,-1)</mo></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0090_d58e7f550b7a.png\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 211px;\"/></p><p>Projection of  <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>PQ</mi><mo>≡</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>QR</mi></math> line with direction ratio <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> is given by, </p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>QR</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>14</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p>Now, in triangle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>PQR</mi></math> we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∴</mo><msup><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>14</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>108</mn><mn>14</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>14</mn><msup><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>108</mn></math></p>"
  }
